WEBVTT

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.000
I hate this!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:51.500
Ah!

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:59.180
Let's go!

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:01.330
Let's all go somewhere!

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:03.930
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:03.930
Ouch

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.810
W-Wait, Tina!

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.960
Hey, that hurts!

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:09.900
Geez.

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:13.070
Come on, let's go, Kaoru.

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:17.010
I'm telling you there won't
be any vacancies at this point.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.950
Do something about that.

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.450
What do you mean something?

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:21.910
Heh, a trip?

00:02:21.910 --> 00:02:24.990
Yay, I want to go on a trip, too!

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:26.120
Is it a trip?

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:27.420
That sounds nice.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.250
Doesn't it? Doesn't it?

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:33.180
But, it's true that checking in at an inn now is...

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:37.830
Miyabi-san, isn't there something we can do?

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.370
Well...

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:43.930
The beach might be difficult,
but perhaps the mountains.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:45.410
Really?

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:48.040
All right! I love the mountains!

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:49.770
There's so much nature there!

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:52.980
We're going to the mountains! Yahoo!

00:02:54.680 --> 00:02:56.650
Thank you, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.390
Tina-san!

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:02.240
My gratitude {Miss Manager}Kanrinin-san, too!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.990
I do not need that kind of gratitude.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:07.450
But it's how I express my love.

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:19.770
It's hot today, isn't it?

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:21.840
It feels great!

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:24.600
When you think of Chika-chan,
you think <i>summer</i>, after all.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.980
But it's too bad Mayu-san can't go, isn't it?

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.850
She said she's at her summer resort, so that's that.

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.890
It's fine! It's fine!

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:35.310
It'll be nice and quiet!

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:37.350
Huh, she's here!

00:03:45.000 --> 00:03:46.410
Sorry I'm late.

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.800
Good work, Miyabi-san.

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:50.670
Wow, a rental car!

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:51.710
Huh?

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:54.500
But isn't it too small for all of us?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:58.570
Aoi-sama and myself will be going in that.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:01.840
Then...

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:04.750
Who's going to drive this car?

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.510
Ah, I am!

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:09.390
Tae?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.890
Tae Nee-chan, you have a license?

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:13.760
Yeah, actually...

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:21.440
Tae Nee-chan!

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.070
Are you all right?

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:25.560
Y-Yes, I'm all right, all right.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.740
Taeko-chan is going to drive!

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:33.080
Yes, Minazuki-san said to please let her drive.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.020
{Miss Manager}Kanrinin-san!

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.840
Please let me go in your car!

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:40.190
Unfortunately, it's a two-seater.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:42.450
Please do something about that!

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.990
Don't squeeze my breasts.

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:53.530
You have the map, yes?

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:55.440
Oh, yes, right here.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.810
We're going to shop on
the way and then head there.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:00.230
So, please go on ahead.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.180
Okay, I got it.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:07.050
Minazuki-san, if anything happens,
please call me immediately.

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:07.980
Okay.

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.120
Well then.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:10.910
See you later, everyone.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:17.000
Well, shall we go, too?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.190
Ah, r-right.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:20.930
Y-Yeah.

00:05:20.930 --> 00:05:23.710
Taeko-chan, drive safely, okay?

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.340
Hmm?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:26.700
I told you it'll be all right!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.340
Oh, no, I can't believe you're all worried.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.930
Believe it or not, I'm told I'm a very good driver.

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.060
Heh!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.080
Really?

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:36.880
Yes!

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:38.910
Well, okay then!

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:41.650
Whew, I was so worried, I almost lost it!

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.920
Okay, take care of it, Taeko-chan.

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:44.900
Right.

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:48.610
By the way, Tae-chin.

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:49.570
Yes?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.290
Who says that you're a good driver?

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.750
The staff at the game center!

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:57.620
Heh!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:08.840
We should be able to get fresh
summer vegetables there, right?

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:09.940
That's true.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:12.380
So, we'll procure our food there-

00:06:16.120 --> 00:06:19.020
Huh, that's Kaoru-sama and the others.

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:25.560
Wow, Taeko-san is really good at driving, right?

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.250
Y-Yes, she is.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:33.240
Save us!

00:06:38.970 --> 00:06:40.170
Hey!

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:47.950
Kaoru-sama.

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:51.010
Aoi-sama.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:56.520
We've arrived.

00:06:56.520 --> 00:06:58.730
Ah, yes.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.560
Was it a good dream?

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:04.200
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:06.530
It seems you managed to arrive safely.

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.500
Yes.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:08.600
And the others?

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:11.590
Oh, Senpai and the others went on ahead.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:25.380
Was Minazuki-san's driving that bad?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:27.980
We almost ran into a guard rail.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:34.960
And we drove sideways.

00:07:34.960 --> 00:07:35.720
Sideways?

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.960
We're going to pass them now!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.230
And we spun out.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:49.900
Spun?

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:52.550
Oh, I took the wrong road.

00:07:52.550 --> 00:07:54.100
I'm turning back!

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.080
Thank goodness we survived!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.080
God, thank you!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:04.760
When we got here, I wasn't able to stand.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:07.190
Good work.

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:08.130
Everyone!

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:12.230
Until the food is ready, please take a bath.

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.130
Huh?

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.090
Did something happen?

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:24.110
It's great that there's an open-air bath here!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.440
My fatigue's flying away.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:30.820
This hot spring is rich with
minerals, so it's good for the skin.

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:34.090
I'll make my skin nice and
smooth, and then go home!

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:36.240
Hey, hey, Miyabi Onee-chan.

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:36.660
Huh?!

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:38.410
What's this?

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:41.300
Oh, that's a marriage meeting window.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:42.750
Marriage meeting window?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:45.070
It was put in as kind of a joke,

00:08:45.070 --> 00:08:48.670
so it was built just to open from
the women's side of the bath.

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:49.840
Heh!

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:54.070
So you can have a marriage
meeting using this window.

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:56.930
Wow, it seems kind of perverted!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:02.050
Oh, there's only one man
in this {building}open bath right now.

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.550
{Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:09:03.550 --> 00:09:06.600
Yahoo, Kaoru!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.960
Wait, Tina Nee-chan!

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:11.570
Kaoru, you spotted!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.160
It certainly is a hairy Kaoru-dono, isn't it?

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.110
Guess who?

00:09:36.120 --> 00:09:37.340
Kaoru-sama.

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:38.810
Correct.

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.000
It's quiet, isn't it?

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:48.980
Yes.

00:09:51.370 --> 00:09:52.730
Kaoru-sama?

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:53.830
Hm?

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:56.500
How are your studies going?

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:58.370
Well, I'm doing my best.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.180
Ah, right.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:05.250
I'll be helping my head
lecturer starting next week.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.850
Heh!

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:10.950
He said it would probably be
best to see an actual workplace.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:13.210
I need to go forward step by step.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.420
Right.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:19.390
A-Are you okay?

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:21.390
I was so scared!

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.080
Aoi-chan.

00:10:36.080 --> 00:10:37.370
Kaoru-sama.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:42.920
Aoi-san!

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:44.580
Please help a bit!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:46.450
O-Okay!

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:48.390
Oh, that's where you were.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:49.380
Oh, man.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:21.530
Ah, geez, this is so boring!

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.990
But the weather truly is fine.

00:11:23.990 --> 00:11:26.790
It doesn't matter how the weather is!

00:11:26.790 --> 00:11:30.750
It's my summer vacation, so why
must I spend it in this place?

00:11:31.090 --> 00:11:33.530
It can't be helped. This is your father's...

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.710
orders, after all.

00:11:36.300 --> 00:11:38.590
I know that.

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:44.390
If at least Hanabishi-sama were here...

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:50.730
Here, here!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.270
Take this!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.210
And that!

00:11:53.210 --> 00:11:55.110
So fascinating!

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:59.690
The thin, striped pattern streams
down its sides so gracefully!

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:02.570
Truly, watermelons just Miura.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:11.500
Have you caught anything?

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:12.930
Yeah, look.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.340
Wow, amazing. So many!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:21.510
Oh, Hanabishi-sama!

00:12:21.510 --> 00:12:22.010
Huh?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:22.590
What?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:29.970
Hanabishi-sama and I are bound
by an invisible red string, after all!

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:34.160
Hey, get away from him, you brat!

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:37.430
Oh, the beast woman is here, too.

00:12:37.430 --> 00:12:39.230
Who is the beast woman?

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:42.240
Mayu-san, are you also at a summer resort here?

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:46.200
There is a Miyuki Group health resort upstream.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:52.630
Delicious!

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:55.440
Please eat a lot.

00:12:55.440 --> 00:12:58.250
The fish that Senpai caught will be roasted soon.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.370
Okay.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.150
<i>Aah～</i>

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.980
Ah, thank you.

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:08.020
Is it taste tasty?

00:13:08.020 --> 00:13:09.720
Yeah, it's tasty.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.520
Then, one more.

00:13:11.990 --> 00:13:13.270
<i>Aah～</i>

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:15.730
Tasty, tasty.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.930
Hey, that was Hanabishi-sama's meat!

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:21.200
Meat goes to the fastest one.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:24.610
Senpai, the corn's roasted.

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.610
Okay, thanks, Taeko-chan.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.980
{Big Brother}Onii-chan, I'll pour you some {yakiniku}grilled meat sauce.

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:31.120
Thanks, Chika-chan.

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:35.080
Hanabishi-sama, it's one more <i>Aah～</i>

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.330
Don't push yourself.

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:40.390
It'd be best to turn down loathsome people, Kaoru.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.620
Who are you calling loathsome?

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:43.670
Would you like to go over there, Aoi-sama?

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:43.670
What was that, you brat?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.920
You needn't hold back.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:47.750
Ah, no. I'll stay here.

00:14:00.380 --> 00:14:02.740
Hanabishi-sama, do your best!

00:14:02.740 --> 00:14:04.110
Endure it, Senpai!

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:07.820
Tina Nee-chan, left hand, blue!

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.010
What?

00:14:10.650 --> 00:14:12.160
Do your best, Tina-senpai!

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:15.160
Blue... Blue...

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:17.430
There you are.

00:14:17.430 --> 00:14:20.840
Whoa! W-W-W-W-W-Wait, Tina!

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:33.310
All times and places, the name
of an unconfirmed creature...

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.680
the chupacabra!

00:14:36.740 --> 00:14:37.610
Huh?

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.350
Tae, what's a chupacabra?

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:41.900
Oh, you don't know?

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:46.860
It's a creature that lives in
South America that sucks blood.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.830
And now the much awaited king game!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.800
Yay!

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.130
King game?

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.570
What's that?

00:14:57.570 --> 00:15:00.200
Huh? Mayu Nee-chan, you don't know!

00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:01.470
I don't, either.

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:02.880
Neither do I.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:03.880
Heh?!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.710
No one knows?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:07.090
Well, I'll be darned.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:12.550
Well, to put it simply, the one who becomes king in this game can command others.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:17.520
All right. And as an example of the rules, I'll be the king first.

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:19.390
Okay, all, pull a stick.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.290
You can't look at the number written on them yet.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.320
Okay! Now here's the command!

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:32.570
Number four gets to put
their head on number one's lap!

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:36.540
T-That's the game?

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:37.370
Yeah.

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.500
But the lap...

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:45.370
Oh, I'm number four.

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:47.420
{Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:15:47.420 --> 00:15:50.590
Whoa, who'll have Kaoru's head on their lap?

00:15:52.550 --> 00:15:54.020
It's me!

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:54.680
What?

00:15:55.060 --> 00:15:57.080
Well, Hanabishi-sama.

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:01.310
Oh, I'm so happy!

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:03.270
I-I can't breathe, Mayu-chan...

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:09.160
Damn you, Mayucchi!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.950
Huh! Next, I am the king.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.830
Oh, Tae-chin, what will you make us do?

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:21.480
Let's see.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:26.390
Okay, number two, please cradle number five.

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.630
Oh, I'm number two.

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:30.210
Cradled by Kaoru!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:35.060
Darn, this isn't it.

00:16:35.060 --> 00:16:37.510
Yay, I'm number five!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:40.330
All right!

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.230
Isn't that wonderful, Chika-san?

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.640
Yeah!

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:46.270
All right, here I come, {Big Brother}Onii-chan!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.030
Kaoru!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.030
Hanabishi-sama!

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.030
Chika-chan!

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:59.190
Ouch!

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:00.950
Geez, Chika-chan!

00:17:02.190 --> 00:17:03.870
I overdid it.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.840
Now then, this will be the last draw.

00:17:10.430 --> 00:17:11.840
Whoa!

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.390
I got the king!

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:16.000
What will it be, Senpai?

00:17:16.000 --> 00:17:20.600
Then the last one'll be to reveal
a secret you'd never tell anyone.

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:23.810
H-Hold on, Tina-senpai.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:25.310
What will you ask?

00:17:25.310 --> 00:17:28.420
I can't tell you what
the Miyuki Group's holdings are.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.110
Who'd want to know that?

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:36.360
Okay, you have to obey the command of the king.

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.530
All right.

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:41.330
Okay, number one!

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:43.730
Tell us who your first love was!

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:47.030
Oh, is that all?

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:49.400
Mine isn't a secret or anything.

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:52.250
Well, who has number one?

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.430
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:01.810
Aoi-chan.

00:18:03.050 --> 00:18:06.950
Well, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, please tell
us the name of your first love!

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.860
Aoi-san, who was he?

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.860
Wow, tell us, tell us!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:20.320
Come, come, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:18:21.140 --> 00:18:22.080
M-

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.840
My...

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:27.290
My first love was...

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.370
The first love was...

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.050
I cannot say.

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:42.760
Eh!

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:44.720
Aoi-chan.

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:48.530
What, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}?

00:18:48.530 --> 00:18:50.360
The game doesn't work like that!

00:18:50.360 --> 00:18:52.370
That's right, Aoi Onee-chan!

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.170
Wow, Aoi-san's face is completely red.

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.170
You're right!

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.860
She looks like a tomato!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:00.800
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord} is pure, after all!

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:23.230
The name of the first person I fell
in love with since I was born...

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:26.350
To be unable to say his name,
even though I love him so much...

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:29.630
Kaoru-sama!

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:37.240
Kaoru-sama?

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.350
Eh!

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:39.110
Aoi-chan?

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.080
Yes.

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:50.790
The moon is beautiful, isn't it?

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:52.160
Yeah.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.600
We're finally alone at last, right?

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:55.790
Yes.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:20:00.800
I love everyone.

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:02.340
Eh!

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:06.100
Tina-san, Taeko-san, Mayu-san, Chika-san.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:09.140
It is very enjoyable beign with everyone.

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:11.750
But...

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:13.100
But sometimes,

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:18.610
I wish that I was able
to spend more time with you.

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:22.610
I wish that I had more time with just you.

00:20:22.610 --> 00:20:23.820
I feel the same way.

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:24.610
Eh!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:26.860
Even when I came here,

00:20:26.860 --> 00:20:29.870
I thought, Aoi-chan might be there.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.120
Kaoru-sama!

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:34.390
Aoi-chan, would you open this?

00:20:35.400 --> 00:20:36.770
Oh, this?

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:39.300
Yeah, I can't open it from here.

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:50.740
Aoi-chan!

00:20:51.490 --> 00:20:52.780
Kaoru-sama!

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:36.960
It's Chika!

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:37.940
It's Natsuki!

00:22:37.940 --> 00:22:38.460
It's Chizuru-

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:40.080
Heh, huh, gah!

00:22:42.250 --> 00:22:43.960
There's a sports contest at the pool!

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:47.980
Chika, you're a fish! You'll become a fish!

00:22:47.980 --> 00:22:50.010
Right, Coach! I'll do my best!

00:22:50.010 --> 00:22:51.140
All right!

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:54.290
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:54.930
Fish and Water!

00:22:55.390 --> 00:22:57.520
<i>Looking forward to it～</i>

00:22:57.520 --> 00:22:58.060
Woah!

00:22:58.480 --> 00:22:59.980
Chizuru-chan!
